#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:1
msgid "Vim and Neovim"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:3
msgid ""
"Vim version 9.1.1042 or better and Neovim version 0.11 or better support "
"Justfile syntax highlighting out of the box, thanks to [pbnj](https://github."
"com/pbnj)."
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:7
msgid "`vim-just`"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:9
msgid ""
"The [vim-just](https://github.com/NoahTheDuke/vim-just) plugin provides "
"syntax highlighting for `justfile`s."
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:12
msgid ""
"Install it with your favorite package manager, like [Plug](https://github."
"com/junegunn/vim-plug):"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:23
msgid "Or with Vim’s built-in package support:"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:25
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"mkdir -p ~/.vim/pack/vendor/start\n"
"cd ~/.vim/pack/vendor/start\n"
"git clone https://github.com/NoahTheDuke/vim-just.git\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:31
msgid "`tree-sitter-just`"
msgstr ""

#: src/vim-and-neovim.md:33
msgid ""
"[tree-sitter-just](https://github.com/IndianBoy42/tree-sitter-just) is an "
"[Nvim Treesitter](https://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter) plugin "
"for Neovim."
msgstr ""
